l":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-gtar","state":"uploaded","size":806925,"digest":null,"download_count":162,"created_at":"2024-11-08T15:47:42Z","updated_at":"2024-11-08T15:47:42Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/pallets/werkzeug/releases/download/3.1.3/werkzeug-3.1.3.tar.gz"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/werkzeug/tarball/3.1.3","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/werkzeug/zipball/3.1.3","body":"This is the Werkzeug 3.1.3 fix release, which fixes bugs but does not otherwise change behavior and should not result in breaking changes vs 3.1.0.\r\n\r\nPyPI: https://pypi.org/project/Werkzeug/3.1.3/\r\nChanges: https://werkzeug.palletsprojects.com/en/stable/changes/#version-3-1-3\r\nMilestone: https://github.com/pallets/werkzeug/milestone/41?closed=1\r\n\r\n- Initial data passed to `MultiDict` and similar interfaces only accepts `list`, `tuple`, or `set` when passing multiple values. It had been changed to accept any `Collection`, but this matched types that should be treated as single values, such as `bytes`. #2994\r\n- When the `Host` header is not set and `Request.host` falls back to the WSGI `SERVER_NAME` value, if that value is an IPv6 address it is wrapped in `[]` to match the `Host` header. #2993","